<div class="registration-form">

  <p> Registration for the study is handled through Camp Horizon starting with the
  January 2018 study. Payment for camp fees will be arranged through camp. To register
  for the study please visit <a href="http://cwngui.campwise.com/Customer/horizon/browser-check-reg.html">the registration page here</a>.</p>

  <p>The camp software is not a perfect fit for this event (for example it will ask you for your "grade" - select "graduate") but it allows for a wider range of payment options.</p>
  <p>Once you navigate through the camp software you can login again at any time. Here are some additional capabilities you might like to know about.</p>
<h3 style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://cwngui.campwise.com/Customer/horizon/browser-check-reg.html" target="_blank"><strong>REGISTRATION DASHBOARD</strong></a></h3>

<p style="text-align: justify;">If you receive mail from Camp Horizon you may already have an account.&nbsp; Call us or send a message to info@camphorizon.org to get a login for your account.&nbsp; Otherwise, just create a new account.&nbsp; We do not use the age for adult groups - so that is optional.&nbsp; Use Graduate for the grade.&nbsp; That lets us know that you are an adult.&nbsp; The address, primary phone, and primary email is provided for all registered guests to the FMBS committee each week.&nbsp; The primary email is where confirmation is sent and any documents (schedules, notes, etc) that the committee wishes to provide before you arrive. So use an email address that you actually check.</p>

<p style="text-align: justify;"><u><strong>LOGIN OR CREATE A NEW ACCOUNT</strong></u></p>

<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="text-align: justify;"><u><strong>CHOOSE:&nbsp; ADD A PROGRAM</strong></u>&nbsp; (That means register for an event) and select CAMP HORIZON EVENTS.&nbsp;<br />
you should see FMBS Guest as an option.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>

<hr />
<p style="text-align: justify;"><u><strong>AFTER YOU REGISTER</strong></u> - <strong><em>OPTIONAL</em></strong> THINGS TO DO BACK AT THE DASHBOARD</p>

<ol>
 <li style="text-align: justify;"><strong><u>$ FINANCIAL:</u> </strong>You can pay all or part of your tuition&nbsp;and make donations for&nbsp;the FMBS using credit cards or checking.<strong> YOU CAN ALSO PAY IN PERSON ON ARRIVA</strong>L</li>
 <li style="text-align: justify;"><strong><u>FORMS - Camper Profile:</u></strong> This is where food allergies can be recorded.&nbsp; Not everything here applies to adults or adult events.&nbsp; But everyone eats and lots of adults have dietary restrictions. <strong>There are no required fields on this form</strong>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
 <li style="text-align: justify;"><u><strong>FORMS -&nbsp;FMBS</strong></u>: This is where you request linens, make special requests (committee or camp), and instructions for Flight Information is here. You can also volunteer to do airport runs.<br />
 <strong>There are no required fields on this form.</strong></li>
 <li style="text-align: justify;"><strong><u>OPTIONAL ITEMS -&nbsp;Transport:</u>&nbsp;</strong>If you need transportation from the airport, this is where you enter your flight information.&nbsp; Choose Airport Transport, then a new button appears called FLIGHTS.&nbsp; The transport folks will get an email with all the flight information that is provided so that they can organize volunteer drivers.</li>
 <li style="text-align: justify;"><strong>OPTIONAL ITEMS - Buddy:</strong> This is where you can put roommate requests.</li>
</ol>

<hr />
<p style="text-align: justify;"><u><strong>SPOUSES COMING TO SERVE</strong></u><br />
If a spouse is coming, you can add her as a CONTACT from the dashboard, but we have to add her as Retreat Staff. Send us an email or give us a call.</p>

